From aeec8ad102e26d604702d9fadca252e01d43456a Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Leviathan <leviathan@vospek.dev>
Date: Sat, 22 Aug 2026 11:35:09 +0800
Subject: [PATCH] W1-01 ZGC: pull-based GC metrics collector

Adds a dependency-free, thread-less metrics collector sampled on read:
per-collector count/time, post-GC heap survival, direct-buffer usage,
and allocation-rate estimation via lazy thread-allocated-byte deltas.

Feeds the W1-01 acceptance dimensions: Allocation Rate, Heap Usage,
GC Pause totals.
